e didn't have  access to the same dark materials  growing up which meant that he never  learned of the horcrux wickedest of  magical inventions  and that's it for this video did you  guys ever think about this let me know  in the comment section below until next  time there is plenty to be learned even  from a bad teacher what not to do how  not to be  you

